  "description": "FedSense is a privacy-preserved federated self-supervised learning framework for collaborative pre-training of remote sensing foundation models (RSFMs) across multiple institutions without sharing private data. It introduces Federated Mutual-guidance Learning, including Server-to-Clients Guidance (SCG) and Clients-to-Server Guidance (CSG), to address model drift from data heterogeneity and high communication overhead.",
